# Workstream canvas

Each workstream (an agent's line of work: a feature, a research thread, a fix spanning sessions) keeps one canvas up to date as it advances, so the owner can see where it stands at a glance. Follow `.cursor/skills/workstream-canvas/SKILL.md`: create it when the workstream starts, update it in the same turn as each step, decision, measurement or blocker, and link it in your summary. Quick one-off questions and single edits don't need one.
